WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.686
And because we've been traveling together, but we use agents, so we

00:00:05.686 --> 00:00:11.060
wanted to start traveling on our own. So, when we joined the boot

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:16.352
camp, for me, I didn't know what to expect, but within the first

00:00:16.352 --> 00:00:19.120
three sessions before we traveled,

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.030
the whole idea of

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.970
traveling had changed.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:29.643
So, the boot camp actually helped us with confidence. Personally, I

00:00:29.643 --> 00:00:33.827
was able to gain a lot of confidence. We traveled, and

00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:38.772
there's some days that we didn't have any planned excursions. We

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:40.600
were taking a cruise.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:45.165
So, there are days when we dock, we're not taking the ship

00:00:45.165 --> 00:00:50.350
excursions. So, based on the boot camp, we were able to do our own

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:53.150
excursions.

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:56.350
We were able to be confident enough

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.110
to just dock out,

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:01.870
get to the port,

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.460
take a cab,

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:08.300
and go to the city within the places where we were going.

